{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54066","headline":"偈 三 · 正原","name":"偈 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刘民周续岂颠痴，弃世犹求远大师。\n今日幸逢玄旨在，须将心地种禅枝。\n（见《淳熙三山志》卷三七）（按：《祖堂集》录正原偈四首，後二首应爲智真作，参本卷智真条。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"正原","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}